{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44999","headline":"奉酬袁使君高春游鶺鴒峰兰若见怀 · 皎然","name":"奉酬袁使君高春游鶺鴒峰兰若见怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鶺鴒中峰近，高奇古人遗。\n常欲乞此地，养松挂藤丝。\n昨闻双旌出，一川花满时。\n恨无翔云步，远赴关山期。\n跻险与谁赏，折芳应自怡。\n遥知忘归趣，喜得春景迟。\n已见郢人唱，新题石门诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}